
LEVEL4 {Fracture: configurable options}

 If you want Fracture to greet players with a short message as
 they log on to the BBS, set this option to YES.

WELCOPT {Greet players at logon? YES} B

 How many Action Points each player receives per day. Action
 Points are spent on actions such as traveling and searching.

DAYAP {Action Points granted to each player per day? 20} N 1 200

 The size of the world, in tiles, along each edge. The world is
 first generated at this size. Changing it later resizes the
 playable area on the next launch; any player left outside the new
 bounds is brought home to their camp.

WLDSIZ {World size (tiles per edge)? 40} N 8 64

