LEVEL4 {Fracture: world evolution}

 The percentage of unexplored tiles regenerated with fresh terrain
 each midnight, during the nightly cleanup. Charted tiles, camps,
 and player-built structures are never changed. Set to 0 to freeze
 the world.

REGENPCT {Unexplored tiles regenerated each midnight (%)? 5} N 0 100

